 intro="Legendary items: useful milestones",
 guideText="From level 45 you can begin the Moria introduction with Rathwald at Echad Dunann in Eregion. Follow the introduction to obtain your first legendary items.\n\nCurrent legendary items use traceries. The archive in Rivendell's Last Homely House offers related barter services. Reforging advances your item; enhancement runes improve its tracery slots. Check the level limits on each item.\n\nSince Update 38, rune rarity determines the number of levels gained. The old separate rarity caps within the same level band no longer apply.\n\nThe Legendary Items Reward Track is available from level 45: Menu > Character > Reward Track. Seasons change; check the dates in game.\n\nProgression no longer ends at 140: Corsairs of Umbar covers levels 140–150, and Kingdoms of Harad raises the standard world cap to 160. Legendary worlds have their own caps.\n\nA new character does not need the old migration instructions for pre-2021 weapons.",
